{"data": [{"author_id": "1347789200", "created_at": "2026-11-08T21:14:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119539089565262195"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/aryangovil/sta…", "end": 304, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/aryangovil/status/2119496139921825967", "start": 281, "url": "https://t.co/Sst3ZD9C2o"}]}, "id": "2119539089565262195", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 114, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119496139921825967", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "The level of fraud that created rightful skepticism kills the BCI advancement as good or at least medium ideas don't spread, less renowned teams don't get funding etc\nWe could have been much further ~decade ago when ads1299 started to sell as it has more than enough quality whats https://t.co/Sst3ZD9C2o", "url": "https://x.com/rudzinskimaciej/status/2119539089565262195"}, {"author_id": "1358892658857545732", "created_at": "2026-11-08T20:58:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119535147624038412"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/Cooperativa/st…", "end": 47, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/Cooperativa/status/2119430719323648056", "start": 24, "url": "https://t.co/vK6nxaMEmZ"}]}, "id": "2119535147624038412", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 12, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119430719323648056", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "BCI ya no es confiable! https://t.co/vK6nxaMEmZ", "url": "https://x.com/Pau_Patriot/status/2119535147624038412"}, {"author_id": "19881436", "created_at": "2026-11-08T21:27:26.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119542336971506045"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 93, "id": "19881436", "start": 80, "username": "ElPeriodista"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "elperiodista.cl/2026/11/robo-a…", "end": 117, "expanded_url": "https://www.elperiodista.cl/2026/11/robo-al-bci-de-concepcion-investigan-fallas-de-seguridad-y-un-botin-millonario/", "start": 94, "unwound_url": "https://www.elperiodista.cl/2026/11/robo-al-bci-de-concepcion-investigan-fallas-de-seguridad-y-un-botin-millonario/", "url": "https://t.co/LkBG5lgwMG"}]}, "id": "2119542336971506045", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 93, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Robo al BCI de Concepción: investigan fallas de seguridad y un botín millonario @ElPeriodista https://t.co/LkBG5lgwMG", "url": "https://x.com/ElPeriodista/status/2119542336971506045"}, {"author_id": "117817623", "created_at": "2026-11-08T21:01:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119535693395341497"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "/PRNewswire/ -- Cognixion Corporation today announced that it is now enrolling participants in the CHOICE study, a research study of a wearable brain–computer...", "display_url": "prnewswire.com/news-releases/…", "end": 270, "expanded_url": "https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/cognixion-now-enrolling-nih-funded-study-of-wearable-braincomputer-interface-communication-device-for-people-with-als-302929082.html", "images": [{"height": 670, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117991751957061632/9prH4voD?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2117991751957061632/9prH4voD?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 247, "status": 200, "title": "Cognixion Now Enrolling NIH-Funded Study of Wearable Brain-Computer Interface Communication Device for People with ALS", "unwound_url": "https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/cognixion-now-enrolling-nih-funded-study-of-wearable-braincomputer-interface-communication-device-for-people-with-als-302929082.html", "url": "https://t.co/uwiWEubRPC"}]}, "id": "2119535693395341497", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 263, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Cognixion's CHOICE study gives 30 people with ALS three ways to talk at home: eye-tracking tablet, AR-glasses BCI, or touchscreen.\n\nPrimary outcome: which one they choose to use.\n\nThe real benchmark for a neural interface: preference.\n\nCognixion: https://t.co/uwiWEubRPC", "url": "https://x.com/singularityhack/status/2119535693395341497"}, {"author_id": "857434936005066753", "created_at": "2026-11-08T21:40:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119545710278266910"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 220, "id": "1452965868", "start": 207, "username": "FridaSiKahlo"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/JaimeQu4124643…", "end": 244, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/JaimeQu41246435/status/2119447539233456341", "start": 221, "url": "https://t.co/Qs2mxxtwOd"}]}, "id": "2119545710278266910", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 4, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119447539233456341", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Insólito que un banco como BCI no tenga una cámara barata apuntando a la bóveda. En cualquier población tienen decenas de cámaras apuntando en las calles. Debieran demandar al banco por negligencia culposa. @FridaSiKahlo https://t.co/Qs2mxxtwOd", "url": "https://x.com/mmartinezm44/status/2119545710278266910"}, {"author_id": "2547395682", "created_at": "2026-11-08T21:23:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119541296771776639"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 13, "start": 2, "tag": "ÚLTIMAHORA"}], "urls": [{"description": "La Fiscalía estima inicialmente en $3.000 millones el botín sustraído desde la sucursal del Banco BCI. Al menos cinco personas habrían participado en el atraco.", "display_url": "diariosurnoticias.com/biobio/2026/11…", "end": 201, "expanded_url": "https://www.diariosurnoticias.com/biobio/2026/11/08/forado-de-60-centimetros-y-herramientas-de-oxicorte-asi-fue-el-millonario-robo-a-banco-en-concepcion/", "images": [{"height": 972, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119541304040583168/XqPW1gWZ?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1800}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2119541304040583168/XqPW1gWZ?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 178, "status": 200, "title": "Forado de 60 centímetros y herramientas de oxicorte: así fue el millonario robo a banco en Concepción", "unwound_url": "https://www.diariosurnoticias.com/biobio/2026/11/08/forado-de-60-centimetros-y-herramientas-de-oxicorte-asi-fue-el-millonario-robo-a-banco-en-concepcion/", "url": "https://t.co/3vhWd19Wnh"}]}, "id": "2119541296771776639", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 24, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "🔴 #ÚLTIMAHORA: La Fiscalía estima inicialmente en $3.000 millones el botín sustraído desde la sucursal del Banco BCI. Al menos cinco personas habrían participado en el atraco 👇\n\nhttps://t.co/3vhWd19Wnh", "url": "https://x.com/dnoticiasDN/status/2119541296771776639"}, {"author_id": "1929209713331437568", "created_at": "2026-11-08T21:22:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119540980592574725"], "id": "2119540980592574725", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "11/9(月)朝6時5分位、左の上瞼の上眼瞼挙筋の真ん中辺りに違法スマート医療BCIテロからBMI-FESで筋に微細な電気刺激を違法にフィールドバックされている。また目を襲うかもしれない。このテロは健常者を脳疾患やALSや神経異常の誤診を誘発する朝鮮創価学会の偽装障害者する世間で言うテクノロジー犯罪", "url": "https://x.com/slO93X1rlC53348/status/2119540980592574725"}, {"article": {"title": "Logical Fallacies and Cognitive Biases That Have Been Used Against Elon Musk "}, "author_id": "1737006011880452096", "created_at": "2026-11-08T21:16:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119539504948314139"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/i/article/2119…", "end": 100, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/i/article/2119532395263348736", "start": 77, "status": 404, "unwound_url": "https://x.com/i/ar